# P0-5: selection renders Win95 inverse — navy #000080 background, white
# text — and wins over spell squiggles. Visual check: the screenshot
# must show white text on navy across the whole line, with no red
# squiggle under the selected misspelled word. ("zzqx" has no
# AutoCorrect entry, so it stays misspelled; "Zzqx" is sentence-capped.)
type "zzqx world"
wait_frames 12
key CTRL+A
wait_frames 6
validate has_selection=true
validate selected_text=Zzqx world
screenshot p0_selection_render
